<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img class="bg" src="/assets/img/photos/contractors-plans.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/contractors-plans-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/contractors-plans.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="kicker">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services for Illinois Claims</h1><p class="lede">From one estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="ilist" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/named-appraiser-representation/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/signing-paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/signing-paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/signing-paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We act as the appraiser you name once you or your carrier demands appraisal under the policy.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/illinois-homeowner-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/craftsman-bungalow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/craftsman-bungalow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/craftsman-bungalow.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="684" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Bungalows, split-levels, farmhouses and new-build two-stories where the estimate leaves out real costs.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/association-commercial-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-apartments.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-apartments-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-apartments.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 03</small><h2>Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Multi-building associations, high-rise condos, retail, warehouses, churches and mixed-use properties.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/hailstorm-roof-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofers-at-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofers-at-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofers-at-work.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="802" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Hail-bruised shingles, dented metal, split membranes and siding that the carrier calls cosmetic.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/tornado-derecho-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wind-torn-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wind-torn-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wind-torn-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 05</small><h2>Tornado, Derecho &amp; Wind Appraisal</h2><p>Straight-line wind, tornado tracks and derecho swaths that lift shingles, topple trees and twist framing.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/basement-backup-water-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 06</small><h2>Basement, Backup &amp; Water Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Burst supply lines, sewer and drain backup, sump failure and roof leaks into finished space.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/fire-soot-smoke-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/fire-gutted-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/fire-gutted-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/fire-gutted-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 07</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Kitchen fires, lightning strikes, wildland grass fires and smoke that travels far beyond the burn.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/polar-vortex-freeze-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/frozen-pipes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/frozen-pipes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/frozen-pipes.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 08</small><h2>Frozen Pipe &amp; Ice Dam Appraisal</h2><p>Polar-vortex pipe bursts, ice dams, snow-load sagging and the hidden water damage that follows.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/household-contents-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/team-meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/team-meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/team-meeting.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 09</small><h2>Contents &amp; Personal Property Appraisal</h2><p>Room-by-room inventories, depreciation schedules and like-kind pricing for furniture, electronics and more.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/adjuster-estimate-audit/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-charts.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-charts-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-charts.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 10</small><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line second opinion on the carrier’s estimate before you decide whether to supplement or appraise.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/impartial-umpire-appointments/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/conference-room.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/conference-room-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/conference-room.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 260px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 11</small><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire appointments for Illinois appraisal panels, chosen by both appraisers or by a court.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Where to begin</p><h2>Most files start with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that shortfall is worth. A review answers that in days, and plenty of disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/appraiser-services/adjuster-estimate-audit/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one step?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and association claims?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>Yes — houses, condos, apartment buildings, retail, office, industrial, churches and townhome associations.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is it only hail?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="a"><p>No. We handle wind, tornado, derecho, water, freeze, fire, contents and other covered losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the carrier’s estimate is right?</h2><p>Send it over. We’ll review it and tell you what we see — free and without obligation.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn dark" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-dark" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
